 "schema": 1,
 "note": "Conformance vectors for the capability model (ADR-0021). The Rust model (windjammer-runtime caps_core, shared with the compiler) and the portable runtimes (std/runtime/js/wj_std.mjs, std/runtime/go/wj_std.go) must agree on every case. Resources are absolute so results do not depend on the working directory; `portable: false` cases need effects Go/JS programs cannot perform.",
